     "   ...the arguement over Professor Davis' theory of parallel
     developement was finally settled in the year 4021.  In that year,
     no less than eight planets, totally unknown to each other, 
     began crusades of Galactic conquest.  Their emergence marked the
     end of the Second Interegum, which followed the Era of Slight
     Darkness under Emperor Blindsides..."

                                   From: "Past Theories in a New Light,"
                                   Professor Walter Rogert Steffen,
                                   Imperial Archeology Weekly,
